<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87045" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδι-έρχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go through before,</i> of motions of the bowels,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				67
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νέστορος προδιελήλυθεν ἀρετὴ τῶν
					Ἑλλήνων τὰς ἀκοάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>go through</i> or <i>narrate before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃν τρόπον γέγραπται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.67
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.2.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					12.3.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of time,
				<i>precede,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ προδιεληλυθότι ἔτει</span> the year
				<i>before last,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1706.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ προδιελθόντι ἔτει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.295.7
				</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
